/shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/2358720/99ece6c2c318265baef5d8ccb348f9ba39ca4972.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":31.299999237060547,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"81063","strName":"十全十美六十三难","strDescription":"十种变化，十个天涯。","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/2358720/d5a57c389865548619ddd63ece35ec6a3b650d0f.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":30.100000381469727,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"81055","strName":"入定蒲团五十五难","strDescription":"钟灵毓秀的打坐之地，已尽收眼底。","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/2358720/404f23735125e0baf64d6c91525a413d691b6cf7.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":29.200000762939453,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"81073","strName":"半个不少七十三难","strDescription":"魑魅魍魉，神仙佛祖都已誊录在册。","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/2358720/7349d97f0b160f8aa98fd9d0003db8c230156251.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":25.5,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"81077","strName":"心有秘方七十七难","strDescription":"这些草头方，可做个全本矣。","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/2358720/269a64481143c9e934715422afb2945186c2875c.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":22.899999618530273,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0}],"vecAchievedHidden":[],"nTotal":81,"nAchieved":0}}],["associations",{"version":2,"data":{"rgDevelopers":[{"strName":"Game Science","strURL":null}],"rgPublishers":[{"strName":"Game Science","strURL":null}],"rgFranchises":[]}}],["descriptions",{"version":1,"data":{"strFullDescription":"《黑神话：悟空》是一款以中国神话为背景的动作角色扮演游戏。故事取材于中国古典小说“四大名著”之一的《西游记》。你将扮演一位“天命人”，为了探寻昔日传说的真相，踏上一条充满危险与惊奇的西游之路。\r\n\r\n[img width=\"1170\" height=\"27\"]https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358720/extras/53c062bc38fc59440d6e9ae53e6e51f2.webp?t=1760601605[/img]\r\n\r\n[imgvid poster.avif=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358720/extras/6d5d441bd83627bcbc6d2b8f8d15f0ff.poster.avif?t=1760601605\" webm=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358720/extras/6d5d441bd83627bcbc6d2b8f8d15f0ff.webm?t=1760601605\" width=\"1170\" height=\"438\"][/imgvid]\r\n[h2]• 雄奇壮丽，光怪陆离[/h2]\r\n别有世间曾未见，一行一步一花新。欢迎来到亦真亦幻的东方魔幻世界！\r\n天命人将前往多个引人入胜又风格迥异的西游故地，再次谱写前所未见的冒险史诗。\r\n\r\n\r\n[imgvid poster.avif=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358720/extras/50a130565eba20a23c614617374844e6.poster.avif?t=1760601605\" webm=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358720/extras/50a130565eba20a23c614617374844e6.webm?t=1760601605\" width=\"1170\" height=\"438\"][/imgvid]\r\n[h2]• 妖魔鬼怪，卷土重来[/h2]\r\n行者名声大，魔王手段强。《西游记》的一大看点，便是各有所长的厉害妖怪。\r\n西行的旅途并非只有风光旖旎，天命人还将遭遇许多强大的敌人与可敬的对手，与他们豪快战斗，至死方休。\r\n\r\n\r\n[imgvid poster.avif=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358720/extras/cac7e67395cc9fbe1463054a2004496a.poster.avif?t=1760601605\" webm=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358720/extras/cac7e67395cc9fbe1463054a2004496a.webm?t=1760601605\" width=\"1170\" height=\"438\"][/imgvid]\r\n[h2]• 山摇地动，各显神通[/h2]\r\n炼就长生多少法，学来变化广无边。五光十色又相生相克的法术、变化与法宝，一直都是中国神话中最为招牌的战斗要素。\r\n天命人除了精通不同棍术，更可自由搭配多样化的法术、变化、天赋、武器与披挂，找到最契合自身战斗风格的制胜之道。\r\n\r\n\r\n[imgvid poster.avif=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358720/extras/717266ac34d8670ca14c77550aad5787.poster.avif?t=1760601605\" webm=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358720/extras/717266ac34d8670ca14c77550aad5787.webm?t=1760601605\" width=\"1170\" height=\"438\"][/imgvid]\r\n[h2]• 千形万象，荡气回肠[/h2]\r\n六般体相六般兵，六样形骸六样情。敌人的凶恶狡猾只是表象，他们的来历、个性与动机，往往更加耐人寻味。\r\n天命人在战斗之外，也会探寻各色人物背后的故事，了解他们的爱与恨，贪与嗔，前世与今生。","strSnippet":"《黑神话：悟空》是一款以中国神话为背景的动作角色扮演游戏。你将扮演一位“天命人”，为了探寻昔日传说的真相，踏上一条充满危险与惊奇的西游之路。"}}]]